translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_a34d1e23:

    # "The room goes silent. The student turns red and sinks into their chair."
    "A sala fica em silêncio. O aluno fica vermelho e afunda na cadeira."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1311
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_7b7fe4e6:

    # "The professor clears his throat and moves on."
    "O professor limpa a garganta e segue em frente."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1322
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_7e3e951a:

    # "She tries to stifle a laugh."
    "Ela tenta segurar o riso."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1328
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_40761418:

    # "You bite your tongue and let the moment pass."
    "Você morde a língua e deixa o momento passar."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1329
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_2881e8a9:

    # "The professor handles it with a polite nod and continues. The student looks pleased with themselves."
    "O professor lida com um aceno educado e continua. O aluno parece satisfeito consigo mesmo."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1330
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_0c9f284b:

    # "You exchange a brief glance with her. She rolls her eyes."
    "Vocês trocam um olhar rápido. Ela revira os olhos."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1334
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_49701497:

    # "A few people nearby snicker. The student looks confused, then offended."
    "Algumas pessoas perto riem. O aluno parece confuso, depois ofendido."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1337
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_f37e0e9d:

    # "She covers her mouth, trying not to laugh."
    "Ela cobre a boca, tentando não rir."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1346
translate pt class_event_obvious_interruption_294326dc:

    # "She presses her lips together, fighting a grin."
    "Ela aperta os lábios, lutando contra um sorriso."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1359
translate pt do_workout_b3520a47:

    # "The gym is closed at this hour."
    "A academia está fechada nesse horário."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1363
translate pt do_workout_eec614b8:

    # "It's getting a bit late to work out, maybe it's better to wait for the next time slot."
    "Está ficando um pouco tarde pra malhar, talvez seja melhor esperar o próximo horário."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1367
translate pt do_workout_011cb5d8:

    # "[_workout_line]"
    "[_workout_line]"

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1372
translate pt do_workout_58eebc9f:

    # "All that hard work is paying off. You feel stronger... like you could last longer. {b}Max Energy up!{/b} (Max Energy: [Player.energy_max]/5)"
    "Todo aquele esforço está valendo a pena. Você se sente mais forte... como se pudesse aguentar mais. {b}Energia Máxima aumentou!{/b} (Energia Máxima: [Player.energy_max]/5)"

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1425
translate pt do_wait_30bbed72:

    # "You spend some time just waiting around."
    "Você passa um tempo só esperando por aí."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1482
translate pt gym_event_arm_suggestion_74547e2f:

    # "She grabs a pair of dumbbells and follows your instructions."
    "Ela pega um par de halteres e segue suas instruções."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1489
translate pt gym_event_arm_suggestion_c62d8983:

    # "You demonstrate the movement. She watches carefully and copies you."
    "Você demonstra o movimento. Ela observa atentamente e te copia."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1496
translate pt gym_event_arm_suggestion_451e1fc6:

    # "She gives you a skeptical look."
    "Ela te olha com ceticismo."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1502
translate pt gym_event_arm_suggestion_793ef35d:

    # "She looks at you, unimpressed."
    "Ela te olha, nada impressionada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1514
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_ca52f7f0:

    # "You head over to the bench press. She's nearby, stretching between sets."
    "Você vai pro supino. Ela está perto, alongando entre as séries."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1515
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_38ddc466:

    # "You load the bar and notice her glancing over."
    "Você carrega a barra e percebe ela olhando."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1536
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_8c3c5a99:

    # "You unrack the bar and immediately feel the weight crushing down on you."
    "Você tira a barra do suporte e imediatamente sente o peso te esmagando."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1537
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_34146543:

    # "Your arms tremble. The bar starts sinking toward your chest."
    "Seus braços tremem. A barra começa a descer pro seu peito."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1539
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_c706c916:

    # "She rushes over and helps you rerack the bar. You sit up, gasping."
    "Ela corre e te ajuda a colocar a barra de volta. Você senta, ofegante."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1541
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_78707016:

    # "She looks more annoyed than worried. Trying to show off clearly backfired."
    "Ela parece mais irritada do que preocupada. Tentar se exibir claramente saiu pela culatra."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1546
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_4f736bde:

    # "You push through the set with visible effort. Your muscles burn, but you keep solid form."
    "Você completa a série com esforço visível. Seus músculos queimam, mas você mantém a forma."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1547
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_6ab28b98:

    # "You rack the bar and sit up, breathing hard."
    "Você coloca a barra de volta e senta, respirando pesado."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1549
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_681eb443:

    # "She watched the whole set. There's a hint of admiration in her eyes."
    "Ela assistiu a série inteira. Há um toque de admiração nos olhos dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1555
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_de672c6f:

    # "You breeze through the set without breaking a sweat."
    "Você completa a série sem nem suar."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1556
translate pt gym_event_bench_press_c5b0b925:

    # "She glances over briefly but doesn't seem particularly impressed."
    "Ela olha de relance mas não parece particularmente impressionada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1572
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_e1270164:

    # "You're in the middle of using [_exercise] when she walks over."
    "Você está no meio de usar [_exercise] quando ela se aproxima."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1580
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_ed5ad01a:

    # "She adjusts the weight and does her set. You wait, watching her form."
    "Ela ajusta o peso e faz a série. Você espera, observando a forma dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1581
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_32de4590:

    # "When she's done, she steps aside with a smile."
    "Quando termina, ela sai de lado com um sorriso."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1588
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_246c3f54:

    # "She crosses her arms, clearly not thrilled."
    "Ela cruza os braços, claramente não empolgada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1590
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_e6f2fc28:

    # "She walks off to do something else. You finish your sets in peace."
    "Ela vai fazer outra coisa. Você termina suas séries em paz."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1598
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_69a730d3:

    # "She gives you a flat look and walks away to use something else."
    "Ela te olha sem expressão e vai usar outra coisa."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1599
translate pt gym_event_leg_swap_6b052961:

    # "Note to self: don't mansplain at the gym."
    "Nota mental: não fique dando lição na academia."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1610
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_31df5b10:

    # "She's at the squat rack, mid-set, when she pauses and turns to you."
    "Ela está no rack de agachamento, no meio da série, quando para e se vira pra você."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1616
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_56494fd0:

    # "She does another rep, focusing on your instructions."
    "Ela faz mais uma repetição, focando nas suas instruções."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1620
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_6e925320:

    # "She finishes her set with a grateful smile."
    "Ela termina a série com um sorriso agradecido."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1625
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_995baf03:

    # "You position yourself behind her for a... better angle."
    "Você se posiciona atrás dela pra um... ângulo melhor."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1626
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_6115a92c:

    # "She does a few reps. You're definitely not looking at her knees."
    "Ela faz algumas repetições. Você definitivamente não está olhando pros joelhos dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1633
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_eaa7b858:

    # "She catches your gaze in the mirror and stops mid-rep."
    "Ela percebe seu olhar no espelho e para no meio da repetição."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1641
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_39754306:

    # "She catches your gaze in the mirror... and smirks."
    "Ela percebe seu olhar no espelho... e dá um sorrisinho."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1649
translate pt gym_event_squat_form_3934ad8d:

    # "She doesn't seem to notice where you're actually looking."
    "Ela não parece perceber pra onde você realmente está olhando."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1663
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_b54abd24:

    # "After her workout, she's on the mat trying to stretch her legs."
    "Depois do treino, ela está no tapete tentando alongar as pernas."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1665
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_4561d1a3:

    # "She looks at you."
    "Ela olha pra você."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1670
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_f1dc4d3a:

    # "You kneel behind her and gently press on her upper back as she reaches forward."
    "Você se ajoelha atrás dela e pressiona gentilmente a parte de cima das costas enquanto ela se inclina pra frente."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1672
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_5d88fab4:

    # "You push a bit further. She groans as the stretch deepens."
    "Você pressiona um pouco mais. Ela geme enquanto o alongamento se aprofunda."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1674
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_9d2e4600:

    # "She sits back up, looking relieved."
    "Ela se senta de volta, parecendo aliviada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1680
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_86bd6df4:

    # "You move in close, pressing your hands on her lower back."
    "Você se aproxima, pressionando as mãos na lombar dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1681
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_ec9b6bae:

    # "Your body is practically against hers as you push her forward."
    "Seu corpo está praticamente colado no dela enquanto você a empurra pra frente."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1690
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_4ee59d83:

    # "She doesn't pull away. If anything, she leans back into you slightly."
    "Ela não se afasta. Na verdade, ela se encosta levemente em você."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1696
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_b64c2dfc:

    # "She tenses up immediately."
    "Ela se tensa imediatamente."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1699
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_5cf63ee0:

    # "You step back awkwardly."
    "Você se afasta sem graça."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1707
translate pt gym_event_stretching_help_04a107f7:

    # "She goes back to stretching alone. A missed opportunity, but no harm done."
    "Ela volta a alongar sozinha. Uma oportunidade perdida, mas sem danos."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1715
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_52287321:

    # "She's at the squat rack doing a heavy set. You can see her legs trembling on the last rep."
    "Ela está no rack de agachamento fazendo uma série pesada. Dá pra ver as pernas dela tremendo na última repetição."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1716
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_c1d0ad8e:

    # "She racks the bar and catches her breath, stretching between sets."
    "Ela coloca a barra de volta e recupera o fôlego, alongando entre as séries."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1720
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_7c820a9b:

    # "You glance away and continue your own workout."
    "Você desvia o olhar e continua seu treino."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1723
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_5e549658:

    # "You walk up behind her and give her a firm slap on the ass."
    "Você vai por trás dela e dá um tapa firme na bunda."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1734
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_a04894a4:

    # "She shoves your shoulder, but she's smirking."
    "Ela empurra seu ombro, mas está com um sorrisinho."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1746
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_a348e0cc:

    # "Her eyes are watering. She covers herself with both hands."
    "Os olhos dela estão lacrimejando. Ela se cobre com as duas mãos."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1752
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_f3cf8fa0:

    # "She turns away, but you catch a faint smile."
    "Ela se vira, mas você percebe um sorriso discreto."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1759
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_e79f5644:

    # "Her face turns bright red. She practically runs to the locker room."
    "O rosto dela fica vermelho. Ela praticamente corre pro vestiário."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1766
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_dfbb50e8:

    # "She swats your hand away, but can't quite hide the flush on her cheeks."
    "Ela afasta sua mão, mas não consegue esconder o rubor nas bochechas."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1772
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_bd5d4c03:

    # "A few people nearby glance over. She's furious."
    "Algumas pessoas perto olham. Ela está furiosa."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1781
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_6213de4e:

    # "She fidgets with the hem of her shirt, clearly flustered."
    "Ela mexe na barra da camiseta, claramente desconcertada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1785
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_b233b337:

    # "She cracks a small smile despite the tough front."
    "Ela deixa escapar um sorriso apesar da pose de durona."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1789
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_62180bd2:

    # "She winks and goes back to her set."
    "Ela pisca e volta pra série."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1793
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_534fc62a:

    # "She glances around nervously."
    "Ela olha ao redor nervosamente."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1797
translate pt gym_event_squat_watch_8a0b18ca:

    # "She adjusts her ponytail, trying to act casual."
    "Ela ajusta o rabo de cavalo, tentando parecer casual."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1815
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_f4486df6:

    # "[_ex_desc]"
    "[_ex_desc]"

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1829
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_4f3759c8:

    # "She quietly lowers the weight, visibly deflated."
    "Ela abaixa o peso silenciosamente, visivelmente desanimada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1833
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_8c6f94bd:

    # "She loads even more weight on the bar out of spite."
    "Ela coloca ainda mais peso na barra por pirraça."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1836
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_dc88be9b:

    # "She lowers the weight, looking disappointed."
    "Ela abaixa o peso, parecendo decepcionada."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1842
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_f8fa9e9b:

    # "She starts the lift. It's clearly too heavy, and she struggles from the first rep."
    "Ela começa o levantamento. Está claramente pesado demais, e ela já luta desde a primeira repetição."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1843
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_c1375fd9:

    # "You stand there with your arms crossed, watching."
    "Você fica ali de braços cruzados, observando."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1846
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_a026ae23:

    # "You wait a few more seconds before stepping in. She sets the weight down, trembling."
    "Você espera mais alguns segundos antes de intervir. Ela coloca o peso no chão, tremendo."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1849
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_396262a9:

    # "Her eyes are glassy. She wipes her face with her sleeve."
    "Os olhos dela estão vidrados. Ela limpa o rosto com a manga."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1854
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_cb79474e:

    # "She grinds through the rep by sheer willpower, face twisted with effort."
    "Ela completa a repetição por pura força de vontade, rosto contorcido de esforço."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1855
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_6e893708:

    # "She racks the weight and turns to you, breathing hard."
    "Ela coloca o peso de volta e se vira pra você, respirando pesado."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1858
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_f4291ea3:

    # "She's furious. But there's a spark of pride in her eyes."
    "Ela está furiosa. Mas tem uma faísca de orgulho nos olhos dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1863
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_c42fef95:

    # "You let her fight it for a few more seconds before finally stepping in."
    "Você a deixa lutar por mais alguns segundos antes de finalmente intervir."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1864
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_6da3e22b:

    # "She racks the weight, arms shaking, and stares at you."
    "Ela coloca o peso de volta, braços tremendo, e te encara."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1867
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_39583354:

    # "She's pissed... but she pushed through something she thought she couldn't."
    "Ela está puta... mas superou algo que achava que não conseguia."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1873
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_62c3441e:

    # "You position yourself correctly and guide her through the set."
    "Você se posiciona corretamente e a guia durante a série."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1874
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_68e596a4:

    # "She pushes through three solid reps with your support."
    "Ela completa três repetições firmes com seu apoio."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1878
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_05f47a6b:

    # "She looks like she might hug you, but catches herself at the last second."
    "Ela parece que vai te abraçar, mas se contém no último segundo."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1884
translate pt gym_event_exercise_help_80444c2f:

    # "She bumps your fist without asking."
    "Ela bate no seu punho sem perguntar."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1901
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_7acff993:

    # "She's at the squat rack with her back to you, doing slow, controlled reps."
    "Ela está no rack de agachamento de costas pra você, fazendo repetições lentas e controladas."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1902
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_8b2860e6:

    # "The view from behind is... hard to ignore. There's a large mirror right in front of her."
    "A vista por trás é... difícil de ignorar. Tem um espelho grande bem na frente dela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1906
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_4ae72387:

    # "You look away and get back to your workout."
    "Você desvia o olhar e volta pro seu treino."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1909
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_b01fb97c:

    # "You pull out your phone and discreetly angle it toward her."
    "Você pega o celular e discretamente aponta pra ela."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1910
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_28779596:

    # "You tap the screen... and at that exact moment, her eyes meet yours in the mirror."
    "Você toca na tela... e nesse exato momento, os olhos dela encontram os seus no espelho."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1916
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_162e7114:

    # "She poses slightly, adjusting her stance."
    "Ela posa levemente, ajustando a postura."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1924
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_c29ec7a8:

    # "She storms over and reaches for your phone."
    "Ela vem furiosa e tenta pegar seu celular."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1926
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_a60c3b4d:

    # "You pretend to delete it. She watches, shaking with anger."
    "Você finge apagar. Ela observa, tremendo de raiva."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1933
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_4fff1d31:

    # "She turns back to the mirror with a faint smirk."
    "Ela se vira de volta pro espelho com um sorrisinho discreto."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1941
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_3529fe64:

    # "She looks around frantically, terrified someone noticed."
    "Ela olha ao redor freneticamente, com medo de alguém ter visto."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1949
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_3a4d094e:

    # "She hugs herself, looking small."
    "Ela se abraça, parecendo pequena."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1957
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_29a8bb19:

    # "You pocket it. She cracks her knuckles but doesn't follow through."
    "Você guarda no bolso. Ela estala os dedos, mas não vai até o fim."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1967
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_97d2bdb0:

    # "She looks away, too intímidated to press the issue."
    "Ela desvia o olhar, intímidada demais pra insistir."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1969
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_534e48bb:

    # "She doesn't believe you. But she doesn't push it."
    "Ela não acredita em você. Mas não insiste."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1975
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_48a0bcc1:

    # "You pocket your phone. She glares, but eventually goes back to her set."
    "Você guarda o celular. Ela te fuzila com o olhar, mas eventualmente volta pra série."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1980
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_3b1a9ec1:

    # "You catch her eye in the mirror."
    "Você cruza o olhar dela no espelho."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1986
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_85c136c7:

    # "She finishes her set, face burning red."
    "Ela termina a série, rosto vermelho."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:1993
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_48fff940:

    # "She racks the bar and flexes."
    "Ela coloca a barra de volta e faz pose."

# game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:2000
translate pt gym_event_squat_behind_9bfd0b5f:

